<title>USA: U.S. Sept factory orders rose 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sept factory orders rose 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted data on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES: Sept--(Prev)	Aug--(Prev)    July</p>
<p> New Orders		  2.7		 -2.1   -1.9	1.7</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation	0.4		 -1.1   -1.1	2.1</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		 2.6		 -2.2   -2.1	2.8</p>
<p> NonDurables		 0.2		 -0.4   -0.4	1.9</p>
<p> Durables		    4.9    4.6	-3.6   -3.5	1.4</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	   15.6   14.1     -10.4  -10.4	7.0</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts     2.5    3.1	-4.9   -4.9	3.7</p>
<p> Defense Cap		 9.4    7.9	 2.0    2.0    -40.7</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES: Sept--(Prev)	Aug--(Prev)    July</p>
<p> Durables NonDefense     4.8    4.5	-3.7   -3.7	3.5</p>
<p> Unfilled-Total	    0.7		 -0.5   -0.3	1.0</p>
<p> Unfilled-Durables	 0.7    0.7	-0.5   -0.4	1.0</p>
<p> SHIPMENTS-PCT CHANGES: Sept--(Prev)	Aug--(Prev)    July</p>
<p>  Total			0.8		  0.1    0.1	1.1</p>
<p>  Durables		   1.4    1.4	 0.4    0.4	0.5</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   Sept--(Prev)   August--(Prev)    July</p>
<p>  New Orders	    319.02	     310.58  311.15   317.30</p>
<p>  -Ex-Transportation  274.09	     273.07  273.26   276.18</p>
<p>  -Ex-Defense	   313.65	     305.67  305.86   312.50</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   Sept--(Prev)   August--(Prev)    July</p>
<p>  NonDurables	   144.61	     144.31  144.35   144.90</p>
<p>  Durables		174.41  174.06   166.27  166.36   172.40</p>
<p>  NonDef. Cap	    47.58   46.98    41.17   41.17    45.94</p>
<p>  -Ex-Aircraft,Parts   37.77   37.98    36.85   36.84    38.76</p>
<p>  Defense Cap	     5.36    5.29     4.90    4.90     4.81</p>
<p>  DurablesNonDefense  169.05  168.77   161.37  161.45   167.60</p>
<p>  Unfilled-Total	505.57	     501.83  502.61   504.11</p>
<p>  Unfilled-Durables   481.39  481.15   477.82  477.89   480.03</p>
